  [38;5;246m2.[39m Send events to a backend
     [38;5;246mA tracking module POSTs login/action events with the userId to an analytics or audit endpoint. Needs an event [39m
     [38;5;246mschema, an endpoint, and a failure/retry policy — a second subsystem alongside the session store.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m In-app audit trail
